{"unit_id":"JohnXu22786__net-debug#card-zh","repo":"JohnXu22786/net-debug","commit":"dc605deb06bddf6a4ffff5ccdea15bc13bd44c36","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-http-debug 是面向 DSH 的 HTTP 调试插件，可通过工具接口或命令行发送 HTTP 请求并检查响应。它在 DSH 工具注册表中提供 http_request、http_history 和 http_rules。请求支持方法、请求头、文本或 Base64 请求体、超时和重定向设置；响应返回状态、头部、正文、耗时和大小，并可验证 JSON 或附加 HAR。插件按会话保存请求历史，可查看、清除并重放记录，也可管理运行时白名单。适合需要从 DSH 或终端调试 HTTP API 的开发者；无需 API 密钥，需 Node.js 18 或更高版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:15-21","src/tools.ts:25-79","src/service.ts:61-104","src/http.ts:124-220","src/cli.ts:1-8"]}
{"unit_id":"JohnXu22786__net-debug#card-en","repo":"JohnXu22786/net-debug","commit":"dc605deb06bddf6a4ffff5ccdea15bc13bd44c36","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-http-debug adds HTTP tools to DSH and a command-line client. It sends configurable requests, displays responses, checks JSON, and exports HAR. Its tools inspect, clear, and replay session history and manage whitelist rules. It is for API debugging and requires Node.js 18+.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:15-21","src/tools.ts:25-79","src/service.ts:61-104","src/http.ts:124-220","src/cli.ts:1-8"]}
